# M55 Scope-Aware Repository Preflight

Normative authority:

- `docs/ssot/M55_GIT_FIRST_ENTRYPOINT.md`
- `docs/ssot/M55_GIT_PREFLIGHT_MANIFEST.json`
- `docs/ssot/M55_SCOPE_AWARE_REPO_PREFLIGHT_SSOT.md`
- `docs/ssot/M55_GIT_FIRST_HARDENING_SSOT.md`

Before substantive M55 work, establish task-relevant Git identity. Then classify exactly one profile:

- `FULL_REPO_PREFLIGHT`
- `CONTINUATION_FAST_PATH`
- `PINNED_REVIEW_PREFLIGHT`

If required task-relevant Git identity or authority cannot be established, use `GIT_PREFLIGHT_INCOMPLETE` and STOP rather than guessing.

## Hard trigger — self-classification cannot bypass known machine paths

`HARD_TRIGGER_FORCES_FULL_PREFLIGHT = TRUE`

First classify intended/observed changed paths against manifest `hardTriggerPaths` and `semanticOwnerPaths`.

A match forces `FULL_REPO_PREFLIGHT`.

Then independently inspect semantics. Money, price/rate/reward, legal/tax, identity/KYC, authorization/security, attribution/ledger, provider behavior, executable state or cross-lane ownership also force FULL when they enter scope, even if the path classifier did not match.

`STATIC_PATH_CLASSIFIER_IS_NOT_COMPLETE_SEMANTIC_PROOF = TRUE`

Do not claim the machine classifier understands all semantic meaning.

## CONTINUATION_FAST_PATH

Use only for an already-authorized bounded continuation lane when either:

- the same active session continues; or
- a valid durable `CONTINUATION_HANDOFF` is freshly reconstructed.

The handoff must contain the manifest-required lane, owner, workspace/ref, authorized task, candidate SHA, mutable paths and observation time. Re-observe Git identity before resume.

If the handoff is missing, stale or contradictory, use FULL. A new chat by itself does not invalidate CLOSED GREEN.

`CONTINUATION_HANDOFF_REQUIRED_FOR_NEW_SESSION_FAST = TRUE`

Do not force unrelated Creator Revenue, Stripe payout, Japan legal/tax or global repo archaeology onto a valid UIUX continuation.

Fresh `origin/main` is not required every turn; require it when integration or relevant touched-authority drift depends on it.

FAST is fast, not blind.

## FULL_REPO_PREFLIGHT

Use for new/consequential architecture, economics, reward, legal/tax, provider, security, DB/ledger/payout, SSOT/governance/roadmap, cross-lane work, hard-trigger changes, unknown existing-contract coverage, or consequential GREEN/freeze/authorization.

Minimum evidence is bounded to relevant authority. When relevant unmerged Human-approved authority may exist, actually query open PRs/stacked branches, pin SHA/timestamp and inspect the relevant owner. `requiredUnmergedAuthority` is not a missing-local-file error and is not permission to fabricate `none found`.

## PINNED_REVIEW_PREFLIGHT

For read-only independent review, pin exact remote PR/branch/commit and exact diff/artifact boundary. If local runtime is unavailable, state `LOCAL_RUNTIME_UNAVAILABLE`; never run local-ref verification and describe it as proof of the pinned remote candidate.

## Lane lock before mutation

`LANE_LOCK_REQUIRED_BEFORE_MUTATION = TRUE`

"Lane Lock" means a required procedural ownership guard, not an atomic distributed mutex.

Before mutation confirm fresh branch/worktree/ref identity, one mutation owner, exact mutable-path allowlist and no known overlap. `M55_WORKTREE_REGISTRY.md` + fresh Git remain authority. Optional `.m55_lane_state.json` is cache only.

Any overlap/ambiguity -> `MUTATION_OWNERSHIP_CONFLICT` / STOP.

Do not mutate protected UIUX worktrees merely to add lane-state markers.

## Context refresh

At a material subtask boundary, re-enter Git-first and reselect FAST/PINNED/FULL.

`SUBTASK_BOUNDARY_CONTEXT_REFRESH_REQUIRED = TRUE`

## External audit findings

An auditor statement is supporting evidence only. Before accepting a blocker, retrieve the exact candidate and acceptance condition and verify the reported reproduction actually matches it.

`AUDIT_REPRODUCTION_MUST_MATCH_EXACT_ACCEPTANCE_CONDITION = TRUE`

The PR #193 operational fixture demonstrates why `2 -> 1 -> 21` cannot disprove an exact `1 -> 12` acceptance contract.

## Escalation

Escalate FAST to FULL on:

- any manifest machine path match;
- semantic money/legal/provider/DB/ledger/security/auth expansion;
- new Human architecture/economic/reward decision;
- SSOT/governance change;
- cross-lane authority collision;
- relevant unmerged authority or relevant main drift;
- unknown existing-contract coverage;
- consequential PLAN/DESIGN GREEN or freeze.

A main SHA change alone is not a global stop. One lane's FULL preflight must not globally block unrelated valid continuations.
